# Codebase-memory (mandatory for .cs)

Server: `user-codebase-memory-mcp`.

1. If repo not indexed → `index_repository` (`d:\Ticket`, mode `full`, persistence `true`)
2. Before edits → `detect_changes`
3. Discovery → `search_graph` / `search_code` / `get_architecture` / `get_code_snippet` / `trace_path`

Fall back to Grep/Glob only for non-code files or when the graph is unavailable — then state `MCP fallback reason: ...`.

See also: `00-enforcement-gate.mdc`.
